===Etymology===
{{suffix|ko|괴|앙이|t1=cat|pos1=now largely obsolete|pos2=diminutive suffix}}. First recorded in 1690, and became popular in the late 19th century. Ultimately from {{der|ko|oko|-}} {{IPAfont|*kwò(y)ní}}, attested in the twelfth-century wordlist ''{{w|Jilin leishi}}''; see {{m|ko|괴}} for more.

